  "blockedReasons": [
    "The bound @img/sharp-libvips-linux-arm64 and @img/sharp-libvips-linux-x64 1.3.4 packages ship versions.json as a publisher declaration, not a complete native-component inventory: it lists proxy-libintl, which the fixed Linux glibc recipe does not build, and omits vendored libnsgif, for which source and exact-ELF observations exist. The upstream recipe is https://github.com/lovell/sharp-libvips/blob/ebb95f8add54eee8bed840e3fb587e4cbec857d7/build/posix.sh; native-libnsgif-copying already binds the vendored component's license source. Upstream package bytes and notices are preserved.",
    "The bound sharp-libvips 1.3.4 binaries have no exact-build final Cargo graph, static-link/object membership, or complete toolchain/base input record. Verified npm provenance and source/license materials do not supply those records; native source and component closure remain unproven."
  ],
